OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FIn this Friday's edition of 'Round
OL,7,     FMidnight, Soweto pays tribute to
OL,8,     Fthe pianist, bandleader and
OL,9,     Fcomposer Mike Westbrook, who sadly
OL,10,     Fpassed away on 11th April aged 90.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FFrom the Basel Martinu Days
OL,13,     FFestival, the Berlin Radio Chorus
OL,14,     Fand New Orchestra Basel play music
OL,15,     Fby Mozart, Dvorak and Martinu,
OL,16,     Fconducted by Christian Knusel.
